package minecraft;

// How a Velocity proxy tells its servers who each player is, for Server.forwarding(): velocity.toml's
// player-info-forwarding-mode. MODERN is Velocity's own, signed with the forwarding secret; LEGACY is
// BungeeCord's, which anyone who reaches a server can forge; BUNGEEGUARD is LEGACY with the secret as a
// token, for servers with BungeeGuard's plugin; NONE tells nothing, so a server sees each player as
// offline, with an offline UUID.
enum Forwarding { NONE, LEGACY, BUNGEEGUARD, MODERN }
